SY_TALK("shAECwIaurU",[[76,["I thank all the Sahaja Yogis"]],[79,["from Derbyshire and Birmingham"]],[85,["for giving Me this opportunity to talk to the seekers of this place."]],[98,["We have seekers in the modern times,"]],[101,["is something very unique."]],[103,["We never had seekers before,"]],[107,["at least not so many."]],[110,["There used to be people"]],[112,["who would seek money, as there are many who are seeking these days,"]],[119,["who would seek countries after countries, the power."]],[125,["There were (not) many who were seeking these"]],[132,["few pearls of bliss of God, very few."]],[142,["The reason was the awareness,"]],[146,["the collective awareness of human beings"]],[150,["did not think themselves perhaps capable"]],[154,["or perhaps needing some seeking."]],[161,["But today it's such a beautiful combination"]],[167,["that there are seekers of very high quality born on this earth."]],[173,["Those who are seeking are in masses."]],[177,["They are not one or two here and there"]],[179,["sitting on top of a mountain,"]],[182,["cave or something and trying to meditate,"]],[187,["but there are so many who are seeking,"]],[191,["who feel dissatisfied with themselves, with whatever they have."]],[197,["They think there must be something beyond."]],[201,["Those who feel that they have not yet found their meaning,"]],[208,["those who feel they have to find the purpose of their life,"]],[213,["those who feel"]],[215,["that there has to be something higher"]],[218,["than what they are into,"]],[221,["all such people are seekers, not of today but of thousands of years."]],[233,["At the time of Christ there were none, I should say,"]],[237,["because even the ones Christ took as His disciples,"]],[242,["they were actually forced into it;"]],[245,["and He had to go and seek them and find them out"]],[248,["and tell them about it."]],[252,["So we have to say that these are very important times"]],[258,["in the history of creation,"]],[260,["where there are so many seekers."]],[263,["But the problem with the seekers today is this"]],[266,["that they don't know what they are seeking."]],[269,["They have no idea as to what to seek,"]],[272,["how to seek, what to expect."]],[276,["It's an unknown area they are entering into."]],[279,["It's very unknown to them."]],[282,["And this unknown area which they are seeking"]],[287,["is now represented by so many people."]],[290,["Everyone says, \"I'm the one who will deliver the goods.\""]],[293,["Another one says, \"I'm the one who can do it.\""]],[296,["Naturally confusion is created,"]],[301,["as it is, modern times are the times of confusion, great confusion."]],[307,["And when there such a confusion comes in, then only we find out"]],[313,["a great solution also, a permanent solution"]],[317,["to solve the problem once for all."]],[320,["There has been never such confusion in the minds of human beings"]],[323,["as it is today as to the right or wrong. Never so much."]],[328,["Whatever was said, \"This was not good,\" they would do,"]],[332,["knowingly that they are doing wrong."]],[334,["If they were good people, they would say,"]],[336,["\"All right, this is good, we'll do the good.\""]],[338,["But everybody knew that this was wrong or right. They may do it."]],[344,["But today no one knows what is wrong and what is right."]],[349,["Apart from wrong and right, it's much beyond that,"]],[352,["you have to know yourself."]],[354,["Because this awareness is within us that we do not know ourselves,"]],[359,["we do not know the absolute. We live in a relative world."]],[362,["Of this everybody seems to be conscious,"]],[365,["maybe in the subconscious or maybe in the unconscious,"]],[369,["but definitely there's a feeling in every one of us"]],[373,["that \"We do not know.\""]],[376,["And it's a very honest feeling,"]],[378,["it's a very sublime feeling"]],[381,["that we have to know something more."]],[384,["Now when we say the word \"know,\" we think as if I would say,"]],[388,["\"I don't know about Derbyshire, I have never been there.\""]],[392,["Now this means what?"]],[394,["I don't know about Derbyshire."]],[397,["What don't I know about Derbyshire?"]],[399,["I can read it in the books, I can find out."]],[401,["I can know all the history of Derbyshire."]],[404,["I can find out who were the people who,"]],[407,["who were making beautiful porcelain here,"]],[409,["I can find out all about their history,"]],[411,["everything I can read about it."]],[412,["Still, why should I say I don't know anything about Derbyshire?"]],[416,["Because I have not been to Derbyshire before."]],[419,["I have not been to Derby, I have not been to this area,"]],[422,["I have not seen this place, I have not visited it,"]],[425,["I have had no experience of this place, so I don't know about it."]],[429,["This is exactly what is the situation."]],[432,["The situation is that we do not know about the Divine."]],[436,["We have read about it, we have heard about it."]],[439,["So many people have written about it."]],[441,["Once they know there's an enquiry about it,"]],[444,["they come out with books. Books after books,"]],[446,["thousands of books they have written."]],[449,["How many of them are true and how many of them are untrue?"]],[452,["It is impossible to find out,"]],[455,["because we do not actually know."]],[458,["Supposing somebody says"]],[460,["that Duke of Bedford was born in Derbyshire."]],[463,["Alright, how will I know?"]],[466,["I would not know till I meet somebody"]],[468,["who is really belonging to that place, who knows about it."]],[472,["In the same way, the knowledge that we have"]],[475,["also about Divine is very confusing."]],[479,["But this is not knowledge, this is never the knowledge."]],[483,["The idea of knowledge comes to us"]],[486,["as if it is a kind of an answer to our enquiries"]],[494,["which is rational, which we can understand intelligently"]],[497,["through our intelligence."]],[499,["But now this area is beyond intelligence, beyond rationality,"]],[505,["beyond all that is limited - is the unlimited area."]],[510,["All such unlimited areas can be only known"]],[514,["by experience of your awareness."]],[518,["Now this one should understand is a very delicate thing,"]],[522,["how to know something, an experience of our awareness."]],[527,["Not an experience, they suddenly see a light, so it's an experience."]],[530,["I mean, you can always see a light!"]],[532,["So great the people feel about it that they have seen some light"]],[537,["suddenly sparking before them. Nothing so great."]],[539,["There could be some area from there a sparking can come,"]],[542,["and maybe it is of no use to you,"]],[546,["but just you might feel that you have experienced."]],[549,["So one must know that seeing is not experiencing."]],[553,["For example, a dog sees this instrument,"]],[558,["but what does he know about it? He sees it."]],[565,["Awareness, the human awareness"]],[569,["has so many great things about itself,"]],[572,["compared to the animal awareness."]],[576,["For example, we can say the awareness of beauty - animals don't have,"]],[581,["awareness of cleanliness - animals don't have."]],[587,["Human beings have these"]],[591,["built within themselves, they can feel it."]],[594,["They can feel it on their central nervous system."]],[599,["So whatever is your awareness,"]],[601,["is to be felt on your central nervous system."]],[604,["It's not just an imaginary thing"]],[606,["or an intellectual discussion,"]],[608,["\"Ah, yes, yes, I know, I know\" - not that way."]],[611,["The knowledge should come to you through your feelings,"]],[617,["like I can feel this is hot or cold,"]],[620,["but a stone will not feel anything."]],[624,["In the same way, the feeling has to come"]],[626,["through your central nervous system."]],[628,["That means your awareness itself is to be going, has to be charged."]],[633,["It has to get a new dimension;"]],[635,["your awareness itself has to get a new dimension."]],[639,["All other experiences"]],[641,["have no meaning whatsoever in evolution, if you see."]],[645,["In evolutionary process it is the awareness that improves,"]],[649,["receives better and better dimensions."]],[653,["And these dimensions have reached its maximum"]],[656,["at the time when you become a human being,"]],[659,["where your awareness is just ready to receive"]],[664,["the awareness of the Universal Being, of the Collective Being,"]],[669,["so that you become the collective being."]],[672,["Now I would like to tell you about this within ourselves,"]],[676,["how we are placed."]],[677,["For every practical purposes"]],[681,["you should not take Me for granted,"]],[684,["but you should not also deny what I tell you."]],[687,["It's like entering into a new university:"]],[692,["We listen to the professor and we try to follow him."]],[697,["Supposing he propounded,"]],[699,["he propounds a hypothesis before you,"]],[705,["then you just start judging it, work it out."]],[710,["If it is true, then you call it a law."]],[718,["In the same way, we should enter into this new understanding"]],[724,["by first seeing it, not denying it."]],[728,["then if it is true, then we have to believe it."]],[732,["There should be no blind faith about Sahaja Yoga."]],[735,["Blind faith does not help at all."]],[738,["Neither there should be a denial."]],[741,["And with that cheerful attitude"]],[743,["if you just listen to Me as a hypothesis whatever I'm telling you,"]],[747,["you need not accept it as truth just now."]],[750,["But then the time has come for Me to prove the truth to you!"]],[754,["And the truth can be proved to you."]],[757,["Time has come to prove the existence of God;"]],[760,["to prove, not prove that I give you a big lecture"]],[766,["or take you to courts or some sort of a thing like that,"]],[768,["but how am I going to prove it? On your awareness."]],[774,["It is going to be absolute experience of your awareness"]],[781,["that you are going to feel God Almighty!"]],[788,["Time has come to prove the scriptures, all the scriptures."]],[794,["The time has come to prove your own connection with God,"]],[801,["your own relationship with Him,"]],[803,["your own relationship with that Primordial Being,"]],[807,["whether you call it \"God\" or anything,"]],[809,["it makes no difference to God Himself."]],[811,["Whether you call Him by any name, there is God,"]],[815,["and that God is not the way you conceive God,"]],[818,["it's not the way you understand God or you know God,"]],[822,["but is the God as He is."]],[825,["Unless and until you yourself feel Him,"]],[831,["you are not going to believe in Him."]],[833,["Even if you believe under certain circumstances,"]],[836,["it's a belief that is blind."]],[838,["It has no meaning for any intelligent person,"]],[841,["and the day will come that such a person"]],[843,["is going to denounce that kind of a blind faith."]],[847,["So now within ourselves, as I said,"]],[849,["is a built-in system which has come to us"]],[853,["through our ascent in our awareness at different stages,"]],[858,["which is like a history written within ourselves"]],[860,["how we become human beings."]],[863,["Into different stages we were divided."]],[866,["First of all the stage of the carbon,"]],[869,["where we became alive,"]],[873,["the dead became the life."]],[877,["That is placed at that point."]],[879,["It is below that great power within us"]],[883,["which lies in the triangular bone, which we call as Kundalini."]],[887,["This power is the power also described in the Bible"]],[894,["as the 'Tree of Life',"]],[896,["'I'll appear before you like tongues of flames',"]],[899,["but Bible being a very microscopic thing,"]],[902,["it cannot be explained, the symbolism of that,"]],[906,["unless and until you get your new awareness"]],[910,["or the vibratory awareness, it cannot be explained."]],[914,["Now this power is the power of desire,"]],[918,["of the ultimate desire, the only desire, the real desire"]],[922,["that we have within ourselves."]],[925,["All other desires become useless."]],[929,["See in the affluent countries now"]],[932,["people have achieved affluence; they are rich, well-to-do;"]],[937,["but they are not happy."]],[940,["People who are extremely affluent like in Sweden"]],[944,["and in Switzerland, they're competing among themselves,"]],[949,["how many youths are going to commit suicide!"]],[954,["Recently I learnt that Swiss people are \"better off\"-"]],[960,["many more Swiss people are committing suicide"]],[963,["than the people who were young people in Sweden."]],[969,["This is the state where we should realise that affluence,"]],[974,["if it was our desire, is not the real desire;"]],[978,["because when we got the affluence"]],[981,["we should have been very happy and joyous people."]],[983,["But we are not."]],[985,["And the basics of economics is that"]],[988,["wants in particular may be satiable,"]],[991,["but in general they are never satiable,"]],[994,["means, matter cannot satisfy your wants."]],[998,["So what is the want, what is the seeking one has?"]],[1002,["Is hidden in this power,"]],[1006,["and that is the seeking to become one with God,"]],[1010,["the yoga, the union with God,"]],[1014,["what we call the baptism."]],[1017,["In the Koran it's called as the pir."]],[1022,["You have to become the pir, the \"twice born.\""]],[1026,["It is described in various languages,"]],[1029,["but the same thing that they have described"]],[1032,["is the same in every scripture."]],[1034,["If you try to follow what it means,"]],[1039,["you'll be amazed that they all said the same things."]],[1044,["Now somebody might say, 'There might be some other methods, Mother,"]],[1047,["it can be something else that can work it out.'"]],[1049,["There's no other method,"]],[1051,["because this has been worked out for thousands and thousands of years"]],[1055,["within yourselves since you became carbon."]],[1058,["And it's all arranged within you by nature."]],[1062,["Like somebody can say that a seed has to sprout"]],[1067,["by some other method - there is no other method for a seed."]],[1070,["The seed has got a primule and the primule has to be awakened,"]],[1074,["is the only way it works out."]],[1077,["In the same way it is going to work out in all of you."]],[1081,["This power is to be shaken within you,"]],[1084,["it is to be awakened within you."]],[1088,["If it is awakened within you, it rises."]],[1092,["But what is this power?"]],[1094,["This power is to become one with the Spirit."]],[1098,["So this power knows that it has to become"]],[1102,["one with the Divine."]],[1108,["Now we have so many other desires,"]],[1111,["so we should say, how is it related to that?"]],[1114,["It's like this, that we have to say,"]],[1117,["'Come to Derbyshire and meet you all, people.'"]],[1122,["Now we come all the way, we come up to Guildhall,"]],[1126,["come up here, and don't meet you."]],[1130,["Then all My coming,"]],[1132,["all My travelling is useless because I've not met you."]],[1137,["It has no meaning whatsoever."]],[1138,["In the same way all other desires"]],[1141,["are just to accomplish this desire, the ultimate desire,"]],[1148,["the desire to become one with the Divine."]],[1153,["Lots of things can be said about Kundalini."]],[1156,["I must have spoken hundreds of times about Kundalini,"]],[1160,["and to know more about it"]],[1163,["you will have to get to Sahaja Yoga and know more about it."]],[1167,["But just now I have told you in brief what is this Kundalini,"]],[1171,["and how it is placed there."]],[1174,["Now the, above that is the second -"]],[1177,["actually the second one we treat as the third one, it looks here -"]],[1180,["is the power of,"]],[1183,["I would say,  (inaudible) this is the centre of our seeking."]],[1192,["This centre is called as the Nabhi Chakra,"]],[1196,["which gives us our seeking."]],[1198,["When we are in the state of animal,"]],[1203,["then we seek food through our stomach."]],[1208,["And you will be amazed then when we become human beings"]],[1211,["also we seek our money through our stomach."]],[1216,["We may get little diverted here and there,"]],[1220,["but ultimately we even seek our God through our stomach."]],[1227,["Surrounding this stomach is the area where one has to cross."]],[1234,["And this area is actually the area of the Masters."]],[1241,["All the Primordial Masters were born in this area,"]],[1245,["like Moses, Socrates."]],[1248,["There are main basic ten primordial beings,"]],[1253,["who came on this earth,"]],[1254,["who came to give us an idea as to our seeking, what we have to do."]],[1261,["Basically they came here to teach us how to balance ourselves,"]],[1267,["how to balance, so we can ascend."]],[1270,["Now all these great prophets or primordial beings,"]],[1277,["we should say they were the ones who were the masters,"]],[1281,["they came to inform us"]],[1285,["that if you cross too much onto the left side"]],[1289,["or too much on the right side,"]],[1292,["then you will be falling in your sustenance,"]],[1296,["in your quality as a human being."]],[1301,["As a human being you have to have a sustenance,"]],[1305,["and this is the centre that gradually unfolds"]],[1309,["the sustenance from animal to higher animals"]],[1312,["and to human stage, where a person starts realising"]],[1316,["that these sustenance’s exist within us."]],[1319,["That's how all our laws have come."]],[1323,["The Ten Commandments of the Bible"]],[1326,["are the ten sustenances that are within us."]],[1329,["These are the ten Gurus who came on this earth"]],[1332,["to save human beings from getting out of the middle path,"]],[1338,["going more to the left and more to the right."]],[1344,["Now the left side, as you see here,"]],[1347,["is the side which is the emotional side within us,"]],[1350,["is also the power of desire."]],[1353,["Is the emotional side which gives us our subconscious,"]],[1356,["and beyond that is our collective subconscious."]],[1359,["On the right-hand side we have another power of action,"]],[1362,["that our desire we try to put in the action,"]],[1366,["and this power of action gives us our future"]],[1371,["and sustains our physical and mental activities."]],[1376,["As a result of that we develop an institution"]],[1380,["in our head called 'ego'."]],[1385,["Everyone has it, there's nothing to be frightened of."]],[1391,["When we do something, we feel we have done it"]],[1394,["and that is a myth, but still we carry on with the myth"]],[1398,["because we have not yet seen the reality."]],[1402,["The another one is the left-side power within us,"]],[1407,["by which we receive the aggression of others,"]],[1411,["by which we have our past,"]],[1417,["gives us an institution as a by-product of our activity,"]],[1422,["emotional activity,"]],[1425,["an institution like a balloon you will see there,"]],[1428,["called as 'super-ego'."]],[1432,["These two things meet in the head just like this"]],[1435,["as you grow,"]],[1437,["and the calcification takes place"]],[1440,["on top of your head near the fontanel bone area,"]],[1444,["and this soft area which is pulsating in childhood"]],[1448,["becomes completely covered."]],[1451,["Thus you developed your I-ness, you become Mr. X, Y, Z and all that."]],[1457,["You develop your own freedom."]],[1459,["This is the freedom that you have achieved"]],[1462,["to be Mr. X, Mr. Y, Mr. Z."]],[1468,["After achieving this you start using the second centre,"]],[1473,["which is the centre of your creativity,"]],[1476,["the centre of your action."]],[1478,["Animals do not have any ego."]],[1481,["Of course, if they live with human beings they may develop,"]],[1484,["but otherwise they have no ego at all."]],[1487,["And if you do something wrong,"]],[1493,["you feel hurt, you feel guilty. Animals never feel guilty"]],[1497,["because it is in their nature to kill another animal,"]],[1500,["it is in their nature to eat, so they never feel guilty."]],[1503,["It's only human beings who'll say, 'Oh, I should not have said this."]],[1506,["I should have not done this.'"]],[1507,["This is only human quality that we feel guilty,"]],[1511,["it is only human quality that we aggress others."]],[1517,["So the second centre comes into play by which you think,"]],[1522,["and you think about the future, you plan."]],[1528,["Your physical -","I think it's too much now, can you stop it?"]],[1532,["Can't you stop it? Better stop the light, it's too much."]],[1537,["I've been having this all throughout, it's too much)"]],[1543,["- and you think; for that thinking you require energy,"]],[1551,["and this energy you get from the cells of fats"]],[1555,["that are in the stomach, which are converted for the use of brain."]],[1561,["And when this conversion takes place,"]],[1564,["this poor centre has to work very hard."]],[1567,["When you think, this centre goes into action."]],[1572,["It has to work very, very hard for one work only,"]],[1576,["and that is to look after the supply of fat cells."]],[1581,["-It's too many lights they have there. Can you put off these lights?"]],[1590,["No, no, no, these three here ..."]],[1602,["Thank you ... Still these are very much,"]],[1605,["these if they can put off, it would be better."]],[1607,["No, no, these three. These three are too much."]],[1612,["There's no need at all, there's three, what is there?"]],[1614,["I mean, they can’t see Me otherwise?"]],[1617,["Can you not see Me? It's like, you feel like","shooting!"]],[1626,["So this, this centre"]],[1629,["that is what we call the Swadisthana centre"]],[1633,["is the centre that gives you your future energy"]],[1641,["to think of your future, your planning;"]],[1644,["which gives you energy to bring forth"]],[1647,["the manifestation of the physical labor,"]],[1649,["of physical exercise or physical work."]],[1654,["This poor centre has to work for one work:"]],[1657,["to convert the fat for the use of the brain."]],[1662,["Now, if one centre which has to do many other things"]],[1668,["starts doing only one work, all other things are","neglected."]],[1671,["As a result of that you develop problems,"]],[1676,["because it has to cater to your liver, to your pancreas,"]],[1680,["to your kidneys, to your spleen,"]],[1685,["and once"]],[1689,["it goes into action for one channelized"]],[1694,["work it gets programmed for it,"]],[1697,["and then it cannot take care of these things."]],[1700,["That's how you develop a bad liver,"]],[1702,["you develop a diabetes,"]],[1708,["kidney trouble, blood pressures."]],[1711,["Also you develop a very serious disease called blood cancer."]],[1717,["Now, Sahaja Yoga can cure all these troubles."]],[1722,["It's only physical, but it can cure even physical troubles,"]],[1728,["because if this centre is brought to its normal behaviour,"]],[1732,["if it is made to behave in a very normal way,"]],[1737,["you can easily cure all such diseases"]],[1742,["which come out of your over activity,"]],[1745,["over-thinking, over-imaginativeness."]],[1749,["It's a very dangerous thing to always think about the future."]],[1753,["For example, now we are here sitting down,"]],[1755,["we should be comfortably sitting down and talking to each other."]],[1761,["Instead of that we are now, we are thinking"]],[1763,["'What am I going to do tomorrow?'"]],[1765,["or 'What am I going to do when I go home?',"]],[1767,["'How I'm going to cook?', 'What am I going to eat?',"]],[1771,["or 'How I am going to take my train?',"]],[1775,["all these futuristic behaviours lead you to a"]],[1780,["very funny personality."]],[1783,["You become so futuristic that you forget the past."]],[1786,["I met a gentleman who forgot even his own name."]],[1790,["He forgot the name of his father,"]],[1793,["he forgot the name of his mother and also,"]],[1796,["to the dismay of his wife, her name."]],[1800,["And she started crying."]],[1802,["She said, \"Now what to do? He's forgotten everything.\""]],[1805,["Now he is in a futuristic area. He just knows the future."]],[1810,["Then he was to be pushed back again into the centre;"]],[1815,["then gradually he started remembering."]],[1817,["Then he told Me that he's chairman of one of the councils"]],[1821,["of a big district place in India,"]],[1825,["and he said, he was - he said, \"No, I am.\""]],[1827,["I said, \"That's good. That's better."]],[1829,["Now you are in that state where you say \"I am.\""]],[1833,["So this is what happens,"]],[1834,["and this is what's going to happen to our societies here,"]],[1838,["which is very futuristic."]],[1841,["So to cut it down one can try anything,"]],[1844,["you may try anything; for example"]],[1846,["you may show pictures of the past and things like that,"]],[1849,["but that is not going to bring back the horse."]],[1851,["it's running very fast."]],[1853,["The only thing that can work it out"]],[1855,["is the awakening of the Kundalini."]],[1858,["When the Kundalini awakens itself,"]],[1861,["She makes the centre enlightened"]],[1866,["and the centre itself resumes its normal shape,"]],[1871,["its normal behaviour and its normal condition."]],[1875,["Apart from that it has got a dynamic"]],[1883,["power or manifestation that this one,"]],[1887,["this centre which looks after our attention becomes enlightened,"]],[1893,["and our attention becomes enlightened,"]],[1896,["and the attention which is enlightened becomes dynamic"]],[1901,["in the sense now, sitting down here you can pay attention to anyone"]],[1905,["- just pay attention, you don't have to do anything,"]],[1907,["just pay attention to that person,"]],[1909,["and you can find out on your fingertips"]],[1911,["what's the matter with the person."]],[1914,["Thousands of miles he may be!"]],[1916,["When Nixon was having trouble, suddenly I don't know,"]],[1919,["I said, \"Find out about Nixon, how is he?\""]],[1922,["And they said, \"Ma, he is in a terrible mess.\""]],[1925,["Christ has said, 'Your hands will speak'. That's the time has come."]],[1928,["These hands which looks so simple;"]],[1932,["but they are so intricate,"]],[1934,["and so intricately built that the nerve endings"]],[1938,["are so microscopic that we cannot understand"]],[1944,["how much they can tell us, how far they can go."]],[1949,["When the awakening takes place"]],[1951,["you start feeling the vibrations around you,"]],[1955,["the all-pervading Power which you have never felt before,"]],[1959,["through these fingertips. These fingertips which we neglect,"]],[1963,["we misuse them, we use them for wrong things,"]],[1967,["these fingertips themselves get enlightened,"]],[1970,["and you start feeling them! That's what I said,"]],[1973,["that you have to get your awareness which is enlightened."]],[1978,["It's the awareness which has to manifest."]],[1982,["And that's how you start feeling them on your fingers:"]],[1985,["It's wrong here, there's wrong there,"]],[1988,["you can see where is the problem."]],[1990,["Now all these are related to your centres."]],[1994,["These are five, six and seven;"]],[1996,["seven on the left and seven on the right."]],[1998,["So this is about your emotional side, and this is about your right,"]],[2002,["about your physical and your rational, or you could say mental side."]],[2008,["So you can make out a person how he is"]],[2011,["by just knowing whether you are getting heat from that person,"]],[2016,["whether you are getting burning from that person,"]],[2018,["whether they are getting numb, whether they are becoming heavy."]],[2024,["And a rapport is established"]],[2026,["with the all-pervading Power which informs you, get the messages."]],[2030,["And the messages are so correct"]],[2032,["that even if you have ten children who are realised souls"]],[2035,["- there are many children these days are born as realised souls."]],[2038,["We don't understand children these days,"]],[2040,["but these days there are great children,"]],[2042,["and they are born today because the time has come."]],[2045,["This is the time of judgment time, this is the time of resurrection,"]],[2049,["this is the time about which people have described"]],[2052,["in all the scriptures."]],[2054,["So great people are taking birth."]],[2056,["And these children, if you tie them up their eyes,"]],[2062,["and ask them about a person who is sitting facing them,"]],[2069,["'What's the problem with this person?',"]],[2071,["they will all raise the same finger."]],[2074,["All of them will raise the same finger, even if their eyes are tied,"]],[2078,["even if their backs are towards the person,"]],[2081,["they can just push back their hands and say."]],[2084,["They are so good, children are so good."]],[2086,["You see, when they put their fingers in the mouth"]],[2088,["we sometimes think -"]],[2090,["I don't know, Freud, whom I'd call a very half-baked person,"]],[2093,["he didn't know much about God and life and nothing at all,"]],[2097,["he was very, little bit he knew"]],[2099,["- he says that this has something towards sex."]],[2102,["He was nothing but a sex point and he wants everybody"]],[2104,["to be a sex point, not a human being."]],[2106,["So this fellow, whatever he may say,"]],[2109,["but the truth is that it has nothing to do with sex."]],[2112,["It is that they feel the heat on their fingers,"]],[2115,["they actually feel it, and that's how they put it in the mouth."]],[2119,["There are little, little children, I've seen; we have one here"]],[2122,["who has come from England,"]],[2125,["from London, and there's another one who is from here somewhere,"]],[2130,["and she - all of these if you ask them"]],[2132,["they will immediately tell you where is the catch,"]],[2135,["which chakra is catching."]],[2138,["Now, children you cannot befool them."]],[2140,["They all tell you the same thing, that this is what is happening."]],[2143,["So your awareness is enlightened and your hands,"]],[2147,["which have got the sympathetic endings here, tell you."]],[2153,["We can say that now in our central nervous system"]],[2157,["we can feel about others and about ourselves."]],[2163,["Now, supposing you are sitting here and"]],[2165,["I ask you, \"What's the problem with you?\""]],[2167,["You would say, \"I don't know what's the problem with me is,"]],[2170,["I don't know.\""]],[2173,["But I may be able to tell you what the problem is."]],[2175,["If you go and see the doctor, you will see, that's the problem."]],[2178,["How do you know? You don't have to go to any examination,"]],[2183,["for all pathological examination where all your teeth are taken out,"]],[2186,["eyes are taken out, and by the time you end up they tell you"]],[2189,["you are the healthiest man!"]],[2192,["You don't have to go to all these horrible things,"]],[2194,["you don't have to waste any money and"]],[2197,["try all these frustrating things."]],[2202,["Just putting your hands, you will know about yourself."]],[2207,["And the people who are sahaja yogis will tell you"]],[2211,["that this is what is wrong with you, and this is how you cure."]],[2215,["Now the time has come - this is such a fantastic time!"]],[2219,["With Sahaja Yoga we have cured so many cancer patients,"]],[2222,["so many blood cancer patients."]],[2224,["Recently a girl who is a Sahaja yogini"]],[2227,["in New York has cured a blood cancer patient."]],[2234,["This boy was about to die, they had declared that he is going to die."]],[2237,["That's declaration they had given about,"]],[2241,["for about fifteen days, they said, he may live,"]],[2243,["and then he is going to die."]],[2244,["I mean, that's the only thing they could do."]],[2245,["With all the things poor fellow had gone through:"]],[2248,["the boy had come from India, all the money was spent,"]],[2250,["and this was the certificate he got,"]],[2252,["that he is going to die within fifteen days."]],[2254,["Now somehow these people contacted Me,"]],[2257,["and I told them to contact a Sahaja yogini in New York."]],[2260,["And they told that such and such boy is there, his name is Rahul,"]],[2264,["he is hardly about sixteen years of age, he had blood cancer."]],[2268,["The boy not only got cured,"]],[2270,["he came down to London to see Me, and he's back in his home."]],[2274,["It sounds very fantastic that how can a person who is not a doctor,"]],[2278,["who has nothing to do with medicine, can cure?"]],[2281,["Beyond all these medicines, beyond all these things"]],[2284,["is the subtle Power, the divine Power"]],[2288,["from where everything has come out."]],[2291,["If you somehow or other become the owner of that,"]],[2295,["or the person who knows how to handle it,"]],[2298,["you can cure anyone you want to."]],[2302,["It's not that I'm curing these days, My disciples are curing."]],[2305,["I don't know how many people this Dr. Warren, who was a doctor,"]],[2310,["has cured through Sahaja Yoga, which is not a medical science."]],[2315,["How many patients he himself has cured,"]],[2318,["he won't be able to count them."]],[2321,["So the whole system is going to change."]],[2325,["Now you are going to become the master of yourself,"]],[2329,["of your powers, and all these powers"]],[2332,["are going to be released from you."]],[2334,["Now when we say that there were gurus who could cure,"]],[2338,["there were gurus who could stop"]],[2343,["a growth of a horrible disease and things like that,"]],[2346,["we think it's not possible. We think it is an impossible thing."]],[2350,["How can it be? How can we believe it? It's a cock and bull story."]],[2353,["But you yourself when you see manifesting it, you'll be amazed."]],[2357,["Once I was travelling by a ship,"]],[2359,["and the captain of the ship, I gave him Realization."]],[2363,["And it so happened that one of the ship's staff"]],[2369,["got into the freezer,"]],[2371,["and he got choked up and he got pneumonia."]],[2374,["Of course, you see, I was in a position, I was travelling because"]],[2379,["My husband was the chairman of that company."]],[2383,["So he would not ask Me to go down,"]],[2386,["he thought it was too much to ask Me."]],[2387,["I said, \"All right, if you don't allow Me to go down,"]],[2389,["you'd better go down to the spot where he is."]],[2393,["Don't send any SOS to call a doctor or anything,"]],[2395,["you just go and put your hand on his chest for about five minutes.\""]],[2400,["His pneumonia got cured completely"]],[2403,["and this captain, he could not believe it."]],[2406,["He said, \"How could it be?\""]],[2407,["I said, \"It is! That has happened to you."]],[2409,["Now you have become that - accept it!\""]],[2412,["You must assume that power, whatever has been given to you,"]],[2415,["as in Sanskrit language we say \"viraj.\""]],[2419,["Assume it."]],[2420,["You see, even if you - I have given a throne, if you don't know"]],[2424,["how to assume the power of the throne, to believe into it,"]],[2427,["then like a beggar boy, if you put him on the throne"]],[2430,["he still sees people coming down, he puts his hand before,"]],[2434,["\"Give me five rupees. Give me five rupees.\""]],[2437,["Unless and until you assume these powers"]],[2440,["you are still uncertain, but you have got them."]],[2442,["And this is the point which is very difficult"]],[2445,["with the western mind specially,"]],[2447,["because they cannot believe that they can have these powers."]],[2450,["They just can't believe it!"]],[2451,["You tell them but they say, \"How can that be?\" But it is so."]],[2454,["Now for example, this instrument."]],[2456,["If you take it to a village and tell them"]],[2458,["that this will carry your voices around,"]],[2461,["or if you take a, say, a television set"]],[2465,["and tell them that you can see all kinds of cinemas,"]],[2471,["or we can say, a drama and play or music out of this -"]],[2477,["he is not going to believe it. He'll say, \"This box?"]],[2479,["This looks like an ordinary wooden box.\""]],[2482,["But when you plug in, it shows its power."]],[2486,["In the same way, what you look at human beings"]],[2489,["as something very, very ordinary, mundane thing -"]],[2496,["for us we take it for granted, ourselves,"]],[2499,["we don't know how glorified we are, how great we are,"]],[2503,["how God has created us with such difficulty,"]],[2506,["with such care, with such love;"]],[2508,["for a very special purpose,"]],[2510,["that He wants to bestow all His powers upon you."]],[2514,["He wants you to enter into the Kingdom of God"]],[2517,["and to enjoy His blessings, His love."]],[2522,["It is something that we cannot believe;"]],[2525,["we are so frustrated, we are so disgusted with ourselves,"]],[2528,["with our societies, with everything."]],[2531,["But it's not so, it's not so."]],[2534,["It just has to happen."]],[2535,["You are just to be plugged in to the mains and it works,"]],[2539,["and it works. It has worked."]],[2541,["It has worked with thousands, and it should work with you."]],[2543,["But the absurd ideas people have,"]],[2545,["which is the conception they have that you can pay for it."]],[2549,["I mean, how can you pay for anything that is living?"]],[2551,["Have you ever paid anything for that is living?"]],[2553,["Like, have you paid anything for getting"]],[2556,["a fruit out of a flower? Can you pay to the flower?"]],[2560,["\"All right, I'll give you one pound, give me a fruit!\""]],[2563,["Will it work out?"]],[2565,["It's that absurd, that you cannot pay for the living God,"]],[2569,["you cannot pay for the living experience"]],[2572,["and you cannot pay for the evolutionary process."]],[2576,["It is spontaneous, it is within ourselves, it works out."]],[2580,["But we understand money so much"]],[2582,["that we can't understand that is free,"]],[2584,["though we have got so many things free."]],[2587,["So many things we have got free,"]],[2589,["still we don't understand the importance of free things,"]],[2593,["because we think whatever is free cannot be great."]],[2596,["Actually all great things have to be free, otherwise we won't exist,"]],[2601,["we won't live."]],[2603,["If we didn't get air to breathe freely, we'll not exist."]],[2608,["If it happens sometimes in the airplane or some place,"]],[2611,["you should see, then people realise"]],[2613,["the importance of those free things which we take it for granted."]],[2618,["So one has to understand the conception"]],[2621,["that we have about God, about achieving Him,"]],[2625,["about getting into ourselves, is also faulty."]],[2629,["We think that supposing we stand on our heads, we'll get it."]],[2633,["I mean, standing on our heads if we can get God, then"]],[2637,["in all evolutionary process they should have stood on their heads!"]],[2641,["Or we think that by running these races we'll get it,"]],[2646,["or by eating this kind of food or that kind of food,"]],[2650,["or by doing this or that we'll get it - is wrong."]],[2655,["But then you may ask that why all these people in religions said"]],[2658,["\"Thou shall not commit this, thou shall not do that\"?"]],[2664,["They said it because these are the things"]],[2667,["which are required for our sustenance,"]],[2670,["for our balancing as a human being."]],[2673,["We lose our balance if we do not do these things."]],[2676,["We have to have the balance; that's why it was said, \"Don't do it.\""]],[2681,["Human beings have a capacity to go to extremes."]],[2683,["I mean, you tell them something - I have known people,"]],[2688,["you just tell them that to cure this particular centre"]],[2692,["you have to do this asana or you have to do this kind of a thing."]],[2696,["They will do it hundred times, thousand times in one day."]],[2700,["I mean, I never asked them, I said just once in a while you do it,"]],[2704,["or once a week - they'll do it hundred times."]],[2708,["We go to extremes."]],[2710,["And that's why, to strike the balance, these people told us,"]],[2713,["\"Don't do this, don't do that, don't do that.\""]],[2717,["But then in our ego we say, \"Why not? What's wrong?\""]],[2720,["All right, go ahead."]],[2722,["When we tell children, \"Don't smoke\""]],[2725,["\"Why not? All my friends are smoking, I'll smoke.\""]],[2727,["All right, go ahead - smoke, get cancer,"]],[2731,["then you'll have a hole here, breathe through that."]],[2734,["After sometime this will go away, the nose will go away,"]],[2737,["and you'll be moving like a machine looking at everyone:"]],[2740,["you can't talk, you cannot live like a normal person."]],[2743,["Then you, one realises that, \"Oh God, I wish I had not smoked.\""]],[2748,["But in Sahaja Yoga we don't say, \"Don't smoke\","]],[2751,["because half of the people will walk off."]],[2753,["We never say \"Don't drink,\" never say anything \"don't.\""]],[2756,["We say, \"All right, you are doing it, it's all right.\""]],[2758,["Let this happen. As soon as this happens you just give up yourself,"]],[2764,["because when you have found the highest,"]],[2768,["then you don't care for all these small things."]],[2772,["All your habits drop out automatically,"]],[2776,["I don't have to force you for that."]],[2777,["You have everything within you, that power, like you get lifted up."]],[2782,["Like a lotus that rises out of the mire by its own force,"]],[2787,["you come up and your fragrance fills that mire,"]],[2790,["and you are amazed at it yourself."]],[2793,["First you are identified with that mire,"]],[2796,["and you think that this is what it is - but it's not so."]],[2799,["When it comes up, that lotus, it spreads its beautiful petals,"]],[2804,["and the fragrance gives us that personality which spreads all over."]],[2809,["And that's what is going to happen to you."]],[2812,["All of you are going to be that lotus which looks hidden,"]],[2817,["which is absolutely invisible within you,"]],[2823,["which is going to open out,"]],[2825,["and the fragrance of your divinity is going to spread."]],[2830,["Now today I cannot cover all the centres,"]],[2832,["because if I start covering all the centres"]],[2834,["it will be a very lengthy thing."]],[2836,["I have covered three centres as you have seen:"]],[2839,["the Mooladhara Chakra, the Swadisthana and the Nabhi Chakra,"]],[2843,["and others I'll cover later on tomorrow."]],[2845,["But I must talk about the Spirit,"]],[2848,["about which we are talking for ages now"]],[2854,["that we have to become the Spirit."]],[2856,["Now English language, as you know, \"spirit\" can be anything."]],[2866,["It's a very ambiguous word:"]],[2870,["even to alcohols we call it spirits,"]],[2873,["even to the dead souls we call them spirits,"]],[2875,["and even to the Spirit that is we are,"]],[2879,["the pure being which is called as \"atma\" in Sanskrit language,"]],[2885,["we call the word \"spirit.\""]],[2886,["Here I am saying, talking about that Spirit"]],[2890,["which is the pure being within you,"]],[2893,["which is a detached being within you,"]],[2895,["which is the witness within you,"]],[2897,["which sees you all the time, which watches you,"]],[2900,["which resides within you as joy and happiness in the heart."]],[2904,["It resides in the heart."]],[2908,["This Spirit is not in our conscious mind,"]],[2912,["is not in our central nervous system,"]],[2915,["is not under our control."]],[2918,["To give it an analogy, I say that"]],[2921,["the left side within us is like the brake"]],[2925,["and the right side is like an accelerator in a car."]],[2929,["Now in the car we are learning driving, sitting in the front seat,"]],[2933,["and there is the master watching at the back"]],[2936,["and seeing the whole play."]],[2939,["Now what you do is to go to the left"]],[2942,["- means sometimes you put the brake,"]],[2945,["sometimes you put the accelerator,"]],[2947,["make mistakes, and then you learn how to drive."]],[2951,["That learning how to drive is the wisdom part of it,"]],[2956,["which comes to us through balancing our lives."]],[2958,["Balance is the most important thing to begin with."]],[2962,["But even if you don't have balance -"]],[2964,["I have seen in Sahaja Yoga very imbalanced people"]],[2967,["get into the balance."]],[2970,["Now this balancing left and right,"]],[2973,["or say, of the brake and the accelerator,"]],[2977,["gives you a position where you can say"]],[2979,["now you have mastered the driving."]],[2982,["But still there is the master sitting at the back."]],[2986,["Then you become the master."]],[2989,["The master is the Spirit within you."]],[2992,["You become the Spirit, and you start watching yourself as a driver."]],[2998,["The whole thing becomes like a play, like a drama;"]],[3002,["that you separate yourself and start seeing"]],[3005,["everything happening before your eyes,"]],[3007,["everything happening just like a drama outside you,"]],[3011,["and you are not the part and parcel of it."]],[3014,["So you enter into the area of your axis,"]],[3017,["and the periphery loses its impact on you."]],[3020,["You become a person who is silent, blissful, quiet,"]],[3027,["and sees the periphery, the movement of the periphery,"]],[3030,["but you are not in it."]],[3032,["That's how you become the master,"]],[3033,["that's how you become the prophet."]],[3035,["But Sahaja Yoga today has a power"]],[3038,["to make the prophets out of the men of God,"]],[3042,["and these prophets will have power to make others prophet -"]],[3047,["so says William Blake, the great poet of this country."]],[3051,["And that's exactly what Sahaja Yoga is."]],[3054,["He predicted it hundred years back."]],[3056,["And today if you come to Sahaja Yoga, you'll be amazed what you are."]],[3061,["Whatever he has predicted about England"]],[3065,["being the Jerusalem of tomorrow, that tomorrow is today."]],[3070,["This country of yours, England"]],[3073,["- which is so far, I don't know if people understand"]],[3076,["are aware of what this country is,"]],[3079,["which is the heart of the universe,"]],[3081,["which is the most important part of the universe"]],[3085,["- has to become the Jerusalem."]],[3087,["For that, the Englishmen have to come out of their inertia"]],[3091,["to see what are their potentials,"]],[3095,["to rise up to that point, and that's going to work out."]],[3099,["It's already is working very well in London."]],[3104,["Of course, we can't have too many people"]],[3107,["because plastics can be produced in the machines in thousands,"]],[3112,["but if you have to have something living it takes time."]],[3115,["But once it takes time, once it comes to its maturity,"]],[3120,["I'm sure this great country is going to assume"]],[3122,["that status of becoming Jerusalem,"]],[3126,["the place of worship"]],[3130,["where people have to come to worship."]],[3134,["It's very surprising, things are happening with Sahaja Yoga,"]],[3137,["the flower daisy which never had any fragrance,"]],[3140,["if you go and see, now is having fragrance."]],[3143,["Most of the English flowers had no fragrance,"]],[3146,["they were known by that."]],[3148,["Most of the flowers are now having tremendous fragrance."]],[3152,["You can see for yourself."]],[3154,["All these things are working by nature, are worked out,"]],[3158,["they are coming- but what about human beings?"]],[3161,["Where are they? What are they doing? Where are they lost?"]],[3165,["This is a very sad thing."]],[3167,["I came to London just by chance, I should say,"]],[3171,["or maybe that is pre-arranged."]],[3173,["My husband got elected to this job and he had to come."]],[3178,["And this agency of the UN is only placed here."]],[3182,["It's in England. It's nowhere else."]],[3185,["You have only one agency of the UN, that is in England"]],[3188,["for which My husband got elected, and so I am here."]],[3193,["Otherwise, I don't think I could have come here like a Guru,"]],[3197,["because I don't have any other interest but this."]],[3203,["And I could not have come here otherwise,"]],[3205,["because uninvited I would not come to a country,"]],[3210,["but I came here as invited person."]],[3215,["It's all working out."]],[3217,["Only you people have to work it out yourself,"]],[3219,["and understand not only the dynamism,"]],[3222,["the vitality, but the greatest importance is that"]],[3226,["at this point you are standing"]],[3229,["on the verge of destruction or construction."]],[3233,["And the English people have a special place."]],[3236,["They have to rise up to it,"]],[3239,["because they are the cells of the heart."]],[3244,["I'll have this lecture tomorrow again."]],[3246,["I'll hope you'll come and make it comfortable."]],[3249,["Sorry for My throat,"]],[3250,["I have been speaking day in and day out, every day."]],[3253,["Thank you very much."]],[3258,["If you have any questions, I would like to answer them."]],[3299,["Can I have (answers) , questions from you and then I’ll answer."]],[3329,["You said You could cure after Self-Realization."]],[3333,["His problem is that his mother is deaf."]],[3344,["Can You fix that hearing problem?"]],[3350,["You see this question is such"]],[3356,["that it makes you feel that I am a person who have to cure everyone."]],[3361,["You are sadly mistaken."]],[3363,["It's a by-product of awakening of the Kundalini, you get cured."]],[3368,["I'm sorry for that, that you have this understanding"]],[3371,["that I'm here to cure all the people."]],[3373,["I should settle down in a hospital."]],[3376,["But main thing is Kundalini has to be awakened"]],[3380,["to get you cured. All right?"]],[3382,["If your mother was here we could work it out."]],[3386,["But the main thing you must understand,"]],[3388,["that God has lot of common sense as we have,"]],[3392,["and He is only interested in such lights"]],[3396,["as we are, which will work out His work."]],[3405,["Those who are, say, very sick people, extremely sick,"]],[3411,["can get cured in a second."]],[3414,["You'll be amazed I'll tell you,"]],[3417,["our President of India, he went to America for his treatment"]],[3423,["and it failed. And he was going back to India."]],[3429,["And I went to see him as Mrs. So and So."]],[3434,["But the High Commissioner told him that"]],[3437,["I'm So and So and he had heard My name in India."]],[3439,["His wife said, \"Why don't you cure my husband?\""]],[3442,["And he was just on his last ..."]],[3445,["they had prepared everything for his last rites in India."]],[3450,["I just put My hand on his back for ten minutes, you won't believe,"]],[3455,["he had not slept for days together with pain,"]],[3458,["he said, \"My pain is relieved, I want to sleep\","]],[3460,["and he got up, he was perfectly all right."]],[3462,["He walked down, people had brought stretchers and things."]],[3465,["He just walked down. They couldn't believe their eyes."]],[3468,["But this has happened because"]],[3472,["he is going to be used for the work of God."]],[3480,["In our house if you have lights"]],[3484,["which are never going to give light, we don't bother about them."]],[3487,["We sell them in the junk."]],[3490,["In the same way, the Divine doesn't cure people, all of them."]],[3500,["It does many thousands"]],[3504,["but some of the people who are very sick,"]],[3507,["He says, \"All right. You go through the second cycle."]],[3510,["All right? Come back purified,"]],[3514,["rested and then it works out.\""]],[3517,["So not necessarily that everybody will be cured, not necessarily."]],[3523,["But so many have got cured and it has worked."]],[3528,["But that's not our main job, is to give cures to people. No."]],[3533,["It is to give realisation to people and as a by-product as you said,"]],[3538,["of course if she gets realisation, her deafness will go away."]],[3543,["Many people have cured their deafness."]],[3546,["Not only deafness but even bald headed people have got hair."]],[3550,["He had no hair on his head when he came to Me, but I don't say;"]],[3556,["that after realisation and before realisation, so tremendous"]],[3560,["that it's better to take photographs before realisation"]],[3564,["and see yourself - dump sometimes!"]],[3566,["After realisation people,"]],[3568,["see, they have got their photographs before realisation,"]],[3570,["they have thrown them away."]],[3574,["It is different."]],[3576,["But the main thing is not curing, it's the Self-realization."]],[3580,["That's the main thing! And age has no problem."]],[3584,["Yesterday I think in Birmingham, we gave realisation to somebody"]],[3588,["who was a very, very old man. So age has no consideration,"]],[3592,["health has no consideration, nothing of the kind."]],[3595,["Everyone can get it and should try to get it."]],[3599,["All right? So if you can get her, we'll work it out."]],[3603,["But I don't promise anything. All right?"]],[3606,["May God bless you."]],[3609,["Of course, Self-realization I promise! That I promise."]],[3613,["If you have patience with yourself as I have with you."]],[3619,["You have to have patience."]],[3622,["Any other question please?"]],[3633,["He has had chest problems for last four or five years."]],[3635,["Is there any way You can help him?"]],[3637,["Of course, that can be helped."]],[3639,["Yes, chest problem like breathing trouble or what?"]],[3642,["Breathing trouble? Is he an Indian?"]],[3645,["Asthma. Are you an Indian?"]],[3647,["Ahh, Indians you know."]],[3650,["They take so much bath. They still think they are in India."]],[3654,["Everyday take bath in the morning and then go out."]],[3656,["Isn't it? That should not be done. This is England."]],[3660,["We should take bath in the night. We should live like English people."]],[3664,["They are great bathers. Indians are great bathers, you see,"]],[3667,["they must have bath every day"]],[3669,["whether it is zero degrees or minus twelve degrees."]],[3673,["They must have bath, you see, it's a habit formation they have got."]],[3677,["They don't feel all right without a bath"]],[3679,["and that's how they develop, but in any case we'll cure your asthma."]],[3681,["All right? It's not so difficult."]],[3685,["But one should not take too much bath in England."]],[3689,["I would suggest that if you want to take bath, take it in the night"]],[3693,["as the English people do, because it's a very treacherous climate."]],[3698,["And if you take your bath and get out of your bath,"]],[3701,["you are definite to catch these troubles in the chest."]],[3705,["Not only that but arthritis and all these things come out of this."]],[3709,["This is very indiscriminating in this country."]],[3711,["The climate is such you have to be careful."]],[3717,["I mean, one should not postpone bathing forever."]],[3724,["Because, you see, when I say something"]],[3726,["I must give the other extreme also."]],[3729,["But we are great bathers, no doubt you see."]],[3732,["Personal cleanliness is too much with Indians, too much."]],[3734,["But general cleanliness or you can say the collective cleanliness"]],[3739,["is more here, you see. Like mowing the lawn and"]],[3743,["looking after the cleanliness of the roads and all much better."]],[3745,["I mean, we have to combine these things. It's important."]],[3749,["That can work out. All right? Asthma is not such a problem."]],[3753,["What else?"]],[3758,["In what way does it work out?"]],[3761,["We have a centre within us which is the centre of Shri Rama"]],[3764,["on the right hand side, we call it the right heart."]],[3767,["And, if we can cure that centre of yours,"]],[3769,["you'll be all right. All right?"]],[3774,["We'll work it out. We'll tell you how to do it."]],[3789,["How many thousands of years"]],[3792,["does the yoga date back from?, she said."]],[3797,["Which yoga you mean?"]],[3799,["Yoga as being the spontaneous Yoga has been there throughout."]],[3805,["You see, what is spontaneous is living."]],[3807,["And the living process has been there throughout."]],[3810,["So we cannot say when it started."]],[3815,["We can say when it got separated."]],[3818,["When God and His Power separated"]],[3821,["and God started watching the whole thing as a witness,"]],[3823,["the God Almighty, and His Power started working it out,"]],[3828,["it created all the universes,"]],[3831,["it created our universe out of which it created now human beings."]],[3835,["And now, it has to become one again."]],[3839,["That creation has to know its Creator."]],[3844,["One, two, three, four - there have been always few people"]],[3852,["getting this connection,"]],[3855,["but today is the time for en masse evolution."]],[3858,["So, for a growth of life you cannot give any time."]],[3863,["You can't say when it started,"]],[3865,["how many years back it has been on."]],[3868,["But today is the blossom time"]],[3871,["when many have to get the blessings of yoga."]],[3874,["All right? Thank you."]],[3890,["What is it?"]],[3892,["You spoke about Kundalini."]],[3894,["For the ordinary person, it's very difficult to awaken."]],[3899,["Ah, who's told you that? It's not so."]],[3903,["You see it is these abnormal people"]],[3905,["when they talk about Kundalini they call it abnormal"]],[3908,["because they don't know how to do it. It's the easiest thing to do."]],[3911,["It's the easiest thing to do if you are an awakened person."]],[3915,["Even a child can do it."]],[3918,["It's those people who say that Kundalini is very difficult"]],[3922,["are the people who have no idea of Kundalini at all."]],[3926,["They are not masters. For a master what is difficult?"]],[3932,["And even an ordinary can become a master,"]],[3935,["then what is difficult?"]],[3937,["These are not masters. These are people absolutely naive,"]],[3942,["money makers, useless people."]],[3947,["They write books without knowing anything about","Kundalini."]],[3951,["They are the misguiding people."]],[3953,["It's the easiest thing to do."]],[3955,["Just under your hand it will move, you will see it moving up"]],[3958,["and you will see it pulsating on the head."]],[3960,["It's not at all difficult."]],[3963,["I told you it's the most vital thing that has to happen"]],[3966,["and all that is vital has to be free and easy - sahaja."]],[3972,["Why? In India we had Nanaka who said,"]],[3975,["\"Sahaja samaadhi laago. Sahaja samaadhi laago.\""]],[3980,["Nobody said it is difficult. Kabira never said it. He said,"]],[3984,["\"Paacho pachiso pakar bulau ek hi dor bandhahu.\""]],[3988,["I'll get twenty-five people together and put them onto one thread."]],[3993,["Those who had the authority always talked like that."]],[3996,["Nobody said it is difficult."]],[3999,["It's only these people who do not know the job,"]],[4005,["who have no authority, talk like that."]],[4008,["Don't believe them."]],[4011,["It's the easiest thing to do. You will see yourself."]],[4014,["But supposing it is easiest, then why should we deny it?"]],[4018,["Supposing I've got the diamond for you free,"]],[4021,["won't you see it, won't you have it?"]],[4026,["Or are we going to feel, \"Oh it's very difficult. How can we do?\""]],[4030,["When I am saying it is easy. You don't have to pay for it."]],[4034,["All right?"]],[4039,["What's it?"]],[4046,["No, that's correct. Sit down, sit down."]],[4051,["All right, all right. Please sit down. I'll tell you."]],[4055,["That's the method people tried. It doesn't work out that way."]],[4058,["Say, your car, is something wrong with your car, all right?"]],[4065,["Now, can you clean it from sitting inside it?"]],[4071,["Can you put it right? You have to get out of it."]],[4076,["So first the Kundalini rising has to be done."]],[4079,["You see, people have confused everything."]],[4082,["Even in Hatha Yoga where there are ashtangas,"]],[4085,["first thing is Ishwar Pranidhana. First is the establishment of God!"]],[4092,["First you have to be connected with God."]],[4095,["Even in Christianity you have to be baptized first."]],[4097,["Of course, it's an artificial one, forget it,"]],[4099,["but you have to be baptised."]],[4101,["Even as a Hindu you have to be christened in a way"]],[4104,["what you call a Yagnopavita, is done at the age of eight years."]],[4108,["That's what realisation is."]],[4114,["Or Mohammed Sahib and all these people use Sumta (no thoughts),"]],[4118,["that's the same thing."]],[4119,["So the first thing is to get your realisation."]],[4122,["It doesn't mean that you become a master."]],[4124,["But awakening of the Kundalini"]],[4126,["and then with the growth of the Kundalini you become a master."]],[4129,["This was the real process but they have put it upside down now."]],[4133,["How can you cleanse yourself"]],[4136,["unless and until you get out of it?"]],[4138,["Supposing My sari is spoilt,"]],[4141,["I have to take out My sari and clean it. Isn't it?"]],[4146,["And that's why it is difficult."]],[4149,["That is it. It's a confusion they have created."]],[4152,["And don't believe in all these stories."]],[4155,["If you try to suppress your ego, it will sit on your head."]],[4158,["Never it will run away."]],[4160,["If you try to suppress your super-ego, it will never help you."]],[4165,["But here automatically it happens,"]],[4167,["and how it happens I'll tell you tomorrow."]],[4169,["By awakening these deities within yourself"]],[4172,["these things are sucked in. Kundalini awakens and does it."]],[4176,["And last of all, if you want Me to confess,"]],[4178,["there is something special about Me that I can do it."]],[4182,["Must be something."]],[4187,["If you don't crucify Me, I'll say that much, not more."]],[4191,["You better find out."]],[4192,["Otherwise the first thing you will do is to crucify Me."]],[4196,["I don't want it anymore."]],[4203,["All right? May God bless you."]],[4208,["Yes, My child?"]],[4221,["It's not any surgery needed for that."]],[4226,["In Sahaja Yoga, we have techniques,"]],[4229,["divine techniques by which we open our heart."]],[4234,["The confusion is on another line also,"]],[4238,["and this confusion has led us into problem."]],[4241,["You see, the confusion is about how our relationships"]],[4246,["should be to ourselves, to others and to the society."]],[4251,["There's a big confusion that started long time back."]],[4255,["When the Smritis were written,"]],[4257,["or we can say when the religion was practiced"]],[4259,["it was just the other way round. We started doing everything"]],[4262,["and that's how we have lost that capacity."]],[4268,["The attitude towards ourselves should be"]],[4271,["that we should try to perfect ourselves."]],[4274,["It's absolutely tyrannical I tell you."]],[4277,["When I tried to perfect Sahaja Yoga, I am tyrannical towards Myself."]],[4282,["The amount of work I take out of this body"]],[4284,["and the amount of exertions I can put in out of this body,"]],[4288,["the stretching of My complete patience to a great extent"]],[4293,["- I work it out."]],[4294,["I mean, normally you know, people get just clenched up,"]],[4297,["\"Oh Mother, this is too much. We can't bear.\""]],[4298,["You have seen it yourself."]],[4301,["But you have to be really tyrannical to perfect yourself."]],[4304,["That should be the way we should work it out"]],[4307,["towards ourselves."]],[4310,["And towards others it should be an ideal relationship."]],[4314,["Like now you have a brother, he is your brother"]],[4317,["- should be ideal brother."]],[4319,["If he is your father, he should be an ideal. But such a confusion!"]],[4323,["The more enlightened, so-called, you become,"]],[4325,["the more elevated you become,"]],[4327,["the confusion is: who is your sister, who is your mother,"]],[4330,["who is your father?"]],[4333,["Then the relationship between the Sahaja yogis also becomes confused."]],[4338,["You are Sahaja Yogis, you are all prophets,"]],[4340,["you must respect each other."]],[4341,["You are all prophets, you speak the same language."]],[4345,["You have to love each other."]],[4346,["It's not rational, it has to happen to you"]],[4348,["because the relationship has to be established,"]],[4351,["that relationship, that ideal relationship."]],[4354,["So many people now you have known that get angry with Me,"]],[4357,["\"Mother, You are too patient with the Sahaja yogis.\""]],[4360,["But they are My children. I have to perfect Myself,"]],[4365,["and My relationship with them should be ideal."]],[4368,["I have to go to a great extent forgiving them"]],[4371,["so that they come up."]],[4374,["So relationship with others should be ideal."]],[4377,["Are you an ideal father? Are you an ideal mother?"]],[4380,["Are you an ideal sister and a brother?"]],[4384,["Are you an ideal citizen towards others?"]],[4388,["But the society has to be pragmatic."]],[4392,["The society has to work it out pragmatically,"]],[4395,["and the pragmatic working out comes by changing."]],[4398,["Supposing today I would say that for India"]],[4402,["we don't need vegetarianism."]],[4404,["For England we need vegetarianism."]],[4409,["It's all pragmatic. The society has to be pragmatic."]],[4412,["Here, we are pragmatic about ourselves,"]],[4416,["not about the society, we are pragmatic about ourselves."]],[4419,["Everything works out. \"What's wrong?\""]],[4423,["A woman who has children will run away with another man."]],[4425,["\"What's wrong?\""]],[4427,["Or a woman who has children can sell"]],[4430,["the country for the sake of her children. \"What's wrong?\""]],[4436,["So this confusion within us creates this problem,"]],[4440,["and that's how we do not know how to open out ourselves."]],[4443,["If we could get rid of our confusions, it could be all right."]],[4447,["It can be done through Sahaja Yoga."]],[4450,["All these confusions have been created by half-baked people"]],[4453,["I would say."]],[4454,["Like there's nothing wrong with the incarnations, with the prophets,"]],[4459,["nothing wrong with them, they are perfect people."]],[4463,["What is wrong with us is our attitude."]],[4466,["And if we can discriminately use our attitude"]],[4469,["towards ourselves, towards others and towards the society,"]],[4474,["everything will work out. It's going to be beautiful."]],[4480,["Because of this confusion our heart is closed."]],[4485,["We are frightened of others. What is there to be frightened?"]],[4488,["Relationship is ideal. What can we do?"]],[4494,["Your relationship as far as they are concerned,"]],[4497,["your relationship, your heart is ideal."]],[4499,["Whatever they do is not the point."]],[4501,["Whatever I do for them has to be ideal."]],[4504,["I have to go on loving them."]],[4508,["I have to go on admiring them, encouraging them, sustaining them"]],[4513,["and giving them what I have to do as My relationship has to."]],[4517,["Say for example, a source of water that is under the Mother Earth -"]],[4525,["does it think what kind of a tree it is,"]],[4528,["what sort of things it is doing?"]],[4530,["It just gives its source, its water."]],[4534,["In the same way, because you are the source,"]],[4539,["so the relationship has to be ideal."]],[4541,["These confusions have worked out"]],[4543,["and rationally we have accepted all these confusions."]],[4546,["And this has led us into this kind of a trap"]],[4550,["that our hearts are closed."]],[4559,["All right?"]]]);
